            <ArticleTitle>Pneumocephalus as a complication of diverticulitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e301-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of pneumocephalus, as a complication of diverticulitis, in a 48-year-old man who presented with back pain and mild disorientation. There are no previous reports of diverticulitis causing this phenomenon.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
